{"page":"SYVN1","gene":"SYVN1","accession":"Q86TM6","protein":"E3 ubiquitin-protein ligase synoviolin","length":617,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"Q86TM6-1","name":"1","synonyms":["b","long"],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000377190.8","ENST00000904688.1","ENST00000904689.1","ENST00000904690.1","ENST00000904704.1"],"refseq":["NM_172230.3"],"refseqProteins":["NP_757385.1"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q86TM6-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q86TM6-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":72.2,"plddt":[[70,5],[90,1],[70,2],[90,18],[70,1],[90,27],[70,1],[90,2],[70,5],[90,4],[70,2],[90,23],[70,13],[90,23],[70,6],[90,32],[70,5],[90,27],[70,13],[90,26],[70,3],[90,21],[70,2],[90,1],[70,47],[90,1],[70,17],[90,1],[70,6],[50,3],[0,4],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,2],[0,4],[50,2],[0,2],[50,1],[0,19],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,2],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,6],[0,59],[50,1],[0,1],[50,1],[0,4],[50,1],[0,1],[50,3],[0,3],[50,2],[0,1],[50,5],[0,2],[50,3],[70,3],[50,9],[70,14],[90,16],[70,5],[50,3],[0,62],[50,3],[70,11],[50,4],[0,3]]}},"features":[{"type":"Topological domain","start":1,"end":4,"description":"Cytoplasmic"},{"type":"Region","start":1,"end":84,"description":"Necessary and sufficient for SEL1L interaction"},{"type":"Region","start":1,"end":251,"description":"Involved in FAM8A1 interaction"},{"type":"Transmembrane","start":5,"end":25,"description":"Helical"},{"type":"Topological domain","start":26,"end":41,"description":"Lumenal"},{"type":"Transmembrane","start":42,"end":62,"description":"Helical"},{"type":"Topological domain","start":63,"end":98,"description":"Cytoplasmic"},{"type":"Transmembrane","start":99,"end":119,"description":"Helical"},{"type":"Topological domain","start":120,"end":140,"description":"Lumenal"},{"type":"Transmembrane","start":141,"end":161,"description":"Helical"},{"type":"Topological domain","start":162,"end":169,"description":"Cytoplasmic"},{"type":"Transmembrane","start":170,"end":190,"description":"Helical"},{"type":"Topological domain","start":191,"end":224,"description":"Lumenal"},{"type":"Transmembrane","start":225,"end":245,"description":"Helical"},{"type":"Region","start":236,"end":270,"description":"Interaction with p53/TP53"},{"type":"Topological domain","start":246,"end":617,"description":"Cytoplasmic"},{"type":"Binding site","start":291,"end":291,"description":"Zn(2+)"},{"type":"Zinc finger","start":291,"end":330,"description":"RING-type; atypical"},{"type":"Binding site","start":294,"end":294,"description":"Zn(2+)"},{"type":"Binding site","start":307,"end":307,"description":"Zn(2+)"},{"type":"Binding site","start":309,"end":309,"description":"Zn(2+)"},{"type":"Binding site","start":312,"end":312,"description":"Zn(2+)"},{"type":"Binding site","start":315,"end":315,"description":"Zn(2+)"},{"type":"Binding site","start":326,"end":326,"description":"Zn(2+)"},{"type":"Binding site","start":329,"end":329,"description":"Zn(2+)"},{"type":"Region","start":480,"end":535,"description":"HAF-H domain; necessary to form higher-order Hrd1 complexes"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":613,"end":613,"description":"Phosphoserine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Homodimer (PubMed:16289116). Interacts with p53/TP53 (PubMed:17170702). Interacts with HTT (PubMed:17141218). Component of the HRD1 complex, which comprises at least SYNV1/HRD1, DERL1/2, FAM8A1, HERPUD1/HERP, OS9, SEL1L and UBE2J1 (PubMed:16186509, PubMed:16289116, PubMed:18264092, PubMed:26471130, PubMed:28827405, PubMed:37943610). FAM8A1 is stabilized by interaction with SYNV1, which prevents its proteasomal degradation. OS9 and UBE2J1 recruitment to the complex may be mediated by SEL1L (PubMed:28827405). SYNV1 assembles with SEL1L and FAM8A1 through its transmembrane domains, but interaction with its cytoplasmic domain is required to confer stability to FAM8A1 and enhance recruitment of HERPUD1 (PubMed:28827405). The HRD1 complex also associates with VIMP and may transfer misfolded proteins from the endoplasmic reticulum to VCP (PubMed:16289116). May form a complex with ERLEC1, HSPA5, OS9 and SEL1L (PubMed:18264092, PubMed:18502753). Interacts with VCP (PubMed:16186510, PubMed:16289116). Interacts with UBXN6 (PubMed:18656546). Interacts with BAG6 (PubMed:21636303). Interacts with NFE2L1 (By similarity). Interacts (via N-terminus) with components of the pre-B cell receptor, including IGLL1 and VPREB1 (By similarity). Interacts with CREB3L3; this interaction leads to CREB3L3 ubiquitination and proteasomal degradation (By similarity)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q86TM6-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":565,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000307289.10"],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,126],[127,178,233],[360,412,206]],"edits":[{"start":127,"end":177,"original":"MERSPNISWLFHCRIVSLMFLLGILDFLFVSHAYHSILTR","replacement":"","added":0},{"start":411,"end":411,"original":"A","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":52,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":51,"foldedMissing":51,"features":[[2,51,0],[8,14,0],[9,21,0],[10,8,0],[11,8,0],[15,1,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q86TM6-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q86TM6-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":68.1,"plddt":[[70,5],[90,1],[70,2],[90,18],[70,1],[90,15],[70,1],[90,10],[70,41],[50,4],[70,35],[90,1],[70,2],[90,3],[70,1],[90,3],[70,22],[90,2],[70,2],[90,1],[70,3],[90,1],[70,12],[50,6],[70,8],[90,2],[70,1],[90,6],[70,2],[90,1],[70,47],[90,1],[70,17],[90,1],[70,5],[50,4],[0,4],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,3],[50,1],[0,2],[50,3],[0,3],[50,1],[0,15],[50,2],[0,1],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,5],[0,1],[50,7],[0,55],[50,1],[0,1],[50,13],[0,1],[50,3],[0,1],[50,5],[0,2],[50,3],[70,1],[50,1],[70,1],[50,10],[70,1],[50,2],[70,7],[90,16],[70,1],[90,1],[70,6],[50,5],[0,36],[50,1],[0,23],[50,4],[70,10],[50,3],[0,4]],"losingConfidence":0}},{"accession":"Q86TM6-3",